rustls-ffi-quic
===============

This is a derivative of rustls-ffi (https://github.com/rustls/rustls-ffi),
the C bindings of Rustls. It starts from the upstream release v0.15.7 and keeps
the upstream history, so the author of every upstream line can be seen in it.

