  and the other authors of rustls-ffi.

The files LICENSE, LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-ISC and LICENSE-MIT are those of
rustls-ffi, and are not changed here. Like rustls-ffi, this project may be used under the
terms of any one of the Apache License 2.0, the ISC license or the MIT license,
at your option.

The changes made here (the QUIC C API, the renaming of the exported symbols,
the build and packaging files) are

  Copyright (c) 2026 Small Gear Lab
  Copyright (c) 2026 Marie

and are offered under the same three licenses, so that they can be sent
upstream unchanged.

Rust crates that are linked into the library keep their own licenses; the
packaging (packaging/rustls-ffi in the small-gear-lab APT repository) lists them.
